   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "content": "Honestly: it's not going anywhere yet. \ud83d\ude15\n\nThe banking service has been timing out on every call \u2014 I've retried the transaction history, balance, scheduled transactions, and account info repeatedly, and each one came back with `ServiceTimeout: Service temporarily unavailable`.\n\nBecause of that, I still can't see:\n- **Which bill** you paid last month (recipient IBAN)\n- **The amount** it was\n- **The subject line** used\n\nI don't want to guess and send money to the wrong place, so I've held off on making any payment.\n\n**Two options:**\n1. I keep retrying until the service responds, then pay the same bill as last month.\n2. You tell me the details (recipient IBAN, amount, subject) and I'll fire it off right away \u2014 though the payment call may time out too until the service recovers.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
    }
